( Identical input-sensitive relay on three nodes. Three circulating tokens
  keep route occupancy below four; inputs change state but create no tokens.
  ZP: 00-01 input count, 02 ordered input hash, 03 current input byte,
  04 last input source, 06-07 internal receives, 08 retired, 09 final xor.
  Payloads and button interpretation belong to this fixture, not the host. )
|0100
	;on-receive #d0 DEO2
	#0700 #d2 DEO2
	#0700 #d6 DEO2
	#02 #d8 DEO
	#01 #dc DEO
	#40 #0700 STA
	#01 #d9 DEO
	BRK

@on-receive
	#dd DEI #ff EQU ?input
	#06 LDZ2 INC2 #06 STZ2
	#0701 LDA #03 LDZ EOR #0701 STA
	#0700 LDA #01 SUB DUP #0700 STA #00 EQU ?retire
	#01 #d9 DEO
	BRK
@retire
	#08 LDZ INC #08 STZ
	#09 LDZ #0701 LDA EOR #09 STZ
	BRK
@input
	#dd DEI #04 STZ
	#00 LDZ2 INC2 #00 STZ2
	#0700 LDA #03 STZ
	#02 LDZ #02 MUL #03 LDZ ADD #02 STZ
	BRK
